			"value": "<p><strong>Once Per Turn</strong> - 1 Creature - Magical</p><p>You can use one of the following effects on a single target:</p><ul><li><p>When you cause a creature to become &amp;reference[prone apply=false] with a spell or Wild Shape feature, you can also push them up to 10 ft. in a direction of your choice.</p></li><li><p>When you cast a spell that pushes a target, you can also knock them &amp;reference[prone].</p></li></ul>",
